criteria:
Inclusion criteria:
- 3 age categories (18–44, 45–60, and > 60 years)
- Normal Voice Handicap Index, Vocal Fatigue Index, and Vocal Tract Discomfort scores
- The last episode of pneumonia, laryngitis, or upper respiratory tract infection occurred more than 3 months ago
Exclusion criteria:
- Potential participants are unable to wear a mask properly during the examination;
- Pregnancy in women;
- Velopharyngeal insufficiency;
- Acute or recent history of voice disorders;
- Asthma and/or COPD;
- Acute allergies affecting the upper respiratory tract;
- Current smokers
